== Specification Syntax

HashQL as a language is frontend agnostic, and currently expressed through J-Expr, a form of S-Expressions (citation needed), but in JSON. This specific format is not suitable for human consumption, as it is overly verbose, and therefore hard to read and write.

Inside of the specification we instead use a fictional syntax for the frontend, which is non-authoritative, but easier to understand.

